This architecture provides:
- **Reliable State Management** - Comprehensive testing of all state transitions
- **Maintainable Business Logic** - Clear separation and thorough testing of domain logic
- **Fast Test Execution** - Focus on state outcomes eliminates slow animation tests
- **Readable Code** - Clear structure visible at the top level
- **Easy Maintenance** - Changes isolated to specific methods and tested separately
- **Better Testing** - State logic tested independently from UI components
- **Consistency** - Uniform patterns across the entire codebase
- **Scalability** - Easy to extend and modify existing functionality
- **Quality Assurance** - Built-in quality checks focused on core functionality
- **Team Collaboration** - Clear guidelines prioritising what matters most

This comprehensive guide ensures consistent, high-quality Flutter development with robust, maintainable testing that focuses on **state management and business logic**! 🚀

